+## Hermes Development & Maintenance Subsections
+
+These topics were previously split into narrow Hermes-only subskills. Keep them under the main Hermes umbrella so discovery happens at the class level.
+
+### Skill Authoring
+
+When creating or revising Hermes skills, treat `SKILL.md` structure and validator constraints as part of Hermes authoring, not as a separate top-level skill category.
+
+Key points:
+- Frontmatter must start at byte 0 with `---`
