+### Plugin Development
+
+When extending Hermes, choose the correct extension surface before coding.
+
+Key points:
+- Distinguish directory plugins, config-driven custom providers, and Python-native provider registration
+- Verify against an isolated `HERMES_HOME` instead of mutating the operator's real profile
